B.Zo=new A.j6("canexport","CanExport SMEs","Grants & contributions","Canada","Competitive support for eligible businesses developing new international markets.","For qualifying export-development projects. Check the current applicant guide, intake and eligible costs; not purchase-price funding.","https://www.tradecommissioner.gc.ca/en/our-solutions/funding-financing-international-business/canexport-smes.html")
